{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04379","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 五 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"市人矜巧智，於道若童蒙。\n倾夺相夸侈，不知身所终。\n曷见玄真子，观世玉壶中。\n窅然遗天地，乘化入无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}